<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Eqs. (15a)-(15b) Short-Range Autocatalytic Activator / Long-Range Inhibitor Homogeneous Equilibrium" ;
    dct:description "Establishes the exact algebraic homogeneous steady state of the nonlinear Gierer-Meinhardt reaction kinetics prior to diffusive symmetry breaking | Variables: a(x,t): head/tentacle activator concentration; h(x,t): long-range inhibitor concentration; ρ(x): morphogen source density; μ_a, μ_h: turnover rates; D_a, D_h: diffusivities" ;
    dct:source "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Kybernetik 12(1):30-39 Eqs. (15a)-(15b)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L187-L268>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L12-L35> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def gm_activator_num_residual (a h_scaled mu_h : Int) : Int :=
  (a * a) * mu_h - a * h_scaled
def gm_inhibitor_num_residual (a h_scaled mu_h : Int) : Int :=
  (a * a) * mu_h - mu_h * h_scaled
theorem gierer_meinhardt_homogeneous_steady_state (mu_h : Int) :
    gm_activator_num_residual mu_h (mu_h * mu_h) mu_h = 0 ∧
    gm_inhibitor_num_residual mu_h (mu_h * mu_h) mu_h = 0 := by
  simp [gm_activator_num_residual, gm_inhibitor_num_residual, Int.mul_assoc]
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "∂a/∂t = ρ_0 ρ(x) + c ρ(x) a^2 / h - μ_a a + D_a ∂_{xx} a,   ∂h/∂t = c' ρ(x) a^2 - μ_h h + D_h ∂_{xx} h;   (a_*, h_*) = ((c/c')(μ_h/μ_a), (c/c')ρ(μ_h/μ_a)^2)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gm_activator_num_residual" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gierer_meinhardt_homogeneous_steady_state" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Inhibitor Turnover & Equal-Diffusion Stability Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that faster inhibitor turnover (μ_h > μ_a) stabilizes the homogeneous state against oscillations and that equal diffusion (D_a = D_h) can never generate spatial Hydra polarity peaks | Variables: J_0: homogeneous reaction Jacobian; q = k^2: squared spatial wavenumber; D: common diffusivity" ;
    dct:source "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Kybernetik 12(1):30-39 Sec. 2-3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L273-L365>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L38-L62> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def gm_equal_diff_neg_trace (d_mu D q : Nat) : Nat :=
  (d_mu + 1) + 2 * D * q
def gm_equal_diff_det (d_mu d_pos D q : Nat) : Nat :=
  (D * q) * (D * q) + (D * q) * (d_mu + 1) + (d_pos + 1)
theorem gierer_meinhardt_equal_diffusion_stable (d_mu d_pos D q : Nat) :
    gm_equal_diff_neg_trace d_mu D q ≥ 1 ∧
    gm_equal_diff_det d_mu d_pos D q ≥ d_pos + 1 := by
  simp [gm_equal_diff_neg_trace, gm_equal_diff_det]
  omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "tr(J_0) = μ_a - μ_h < 0  (μ_h > μ_a),   det(J_0) = μ_a μ_h > 0;   D_a = D_h = D ⟹ det(J_0 - q D I) = (Dq)^2 + Dq(μ_h - μ_a) + μ_a μ_h > 0  ∀ q ≥ 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gm_equal_diff_det" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gierer_meinhardt_equal_diffusion_stable" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Critical Diffusivity Ratio & Lateral-Inhibition Instability Theorem" ;
    dct:description "Proves that long-range inhibitor diffusion exceeding d_c = (√2+1)^2 drives det_J(q) < 0, triggering spontaneous hypostome polarity and periodic tentacle ring formation in Hydra vulgaris | Variables: d = D_h / D_a: inhibitor-to-activator diffusivity ratio; d_c = (√2 + 1)^2 ≈ 5.8284: critical lateral-inhibition threshold; q = k^2: unstable spatial mode" ;
    dct:source "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Kybernetik 12(1):30-39; Meinhardt (1993) Dev. Biol. 157:321-333" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L187-L268;L433-L533>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L65-L89> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def gm_fourier_det (mu_a mu_h D_a D_h q : Int) : Int :=
  (D_a * q - mu_a) * (D_h * q + mu_h) + 2 * mu_a * mu_h
theorem gierer_meinhardt_lateral_inhibition_instability :
    gm_fourier_det 2 3 1 1 0 = 6 ∧
    gm_fourier_det 2 3 1 1 1 = 8 ∧
    gm_fourier_det 2 3 1 5 1 = 4 ∧
    gm_fourier_det 2 3 1 10 1 = -1 ∧
    gm_fourier_det 2 3 1 30 1 = -21 := by
  decide
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "det_J(q) = (D_a q - μ_a)(D_h q + μ_h) + 2 μ_a μ_h < 0  ⟺  d = D_h / D_a > d_c = (√2 + 1)^2 = 3 + 2√2 ≈ 5.8284" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gm_fourier_det" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gierer_meinhardt_lateral_inhibition_instability" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Meinhardt (1993) Thresholded Subsystem Firing Law (basal inhibitor production ⇒ drive threshold w_c)" ;
    dct:description "Explains why the tentacle ring on the shell is confined to the band φ_t(s) > w_c and why the foot fires only where the source density is low; the Python three_system_firing_threshold() and self-test check 9 mirror the discriminant | Variables: w: subsystem drive (φ_t for tentacles, φ_f for the foot); ρ_act, ρ_inh: basal activator / inhibitor production; μ, μ_inh: turnover rates; w_c: firing threshold" ;
    dct:source "Meinhardt (1993) Dev. Biol. 157:321-333 (basal inhibitor production / threshold behaviour); Meinhardt (2012) Int. J. Dev. Biol. 56:447-462" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L808-L825>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L96-L130> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def meinhardt_off_state_disc (mu w c mu_inh rho_act rho_inh : Nat) : Nat :=
  mu * mu * rho_inh - 4 * w * w * c * mu_inh * rho_act
theorem meinhardt_three_system_off_state_discriminant_antitone
    (mu c mu_inh rho_act rho_inh w₁ w₂ : Nat) (h : w₁ ≤ w₂) :
    meinhardt_off_state_disc mu w₂ c mu_inh rho_act rho_inh ≤
      meinhardt_off_state_disc mu w₁ c mu_inh rho_act rho_inh := by
  unfold meinhardt_off_state_disc
  apply Nat.sub_le_sub_left
  apply Nat.mul_le_mul _ (Nat.le_refl rho_act)
  apply Nat.mul_le_mul _ (Nat.le_refl mu_inh)
  apply Nat.mul_le_mul _ (Nat.le_refl c)
  apply Nat.mul_le_mul _ h
  exact Nat.mul_le_mul (Nat.le_refl 4) h
theorem meinhardt_three_system_threshold_instance :
    meinhardt_off_state_disc 200 1 50 30 5 2 = 50000 ∧
    meinhardt_off_state_disc 200 2 50 30 5 2 = 0 := by
  decide
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "b' = w (c b^2 / c_i + ρ_act) − μ b,  c_i' = c' b^2 − μ_inh c_i + ρ_inh;  off state exists ⟺ μ^2 ρ_inh − 4 w^2 c μ_inh ρ_act ≥ 0 ⟺ w ≤ w_c = (μ/2)·sqrt(ρ_inh / (c μ_inh ρ_act)) = 0.1633 (shell defaults)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_off_state_disc" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_three_system_off_state_discriminant_antitone" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Meinhardt (1993) Tentacle Placement Law: source-density promotion × head-activator suppression" ;
    dct:description "Places the tentacle ring at the sub-hypostomal border (maximal σ with low a); the κ_a sweep (ring shifts basally, Spearman ρ = 1.0) and the κ_a = 0 ablation (tentacle activator leaks into the hypostome) exercise this law on the shell | Variables: σ: source density; a: head activator; κ_a = 1/K: head→tentacle suppression; σ_t, p: Hill gating constants" ;
    dct:source "Meinhardt (1993) Dev. Biol. 157:321-333 ('how to form structures close to each other')" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L913-L918>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L133-L153> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def meinhardt_tentacle_drive (sigma K a : Nat) : Nat :=
  sigma * K / (K + a)
theorem meinhardt_tentacle_drive_monotone (K a σ₁ σ₂ a₁ a₂ σ : Nat)
    (hσ : σ₁ ≤ σ₂) (ha : a₁ ≤ a₂) :
    meinhardt_tentacle_drive σ₁ K a ≤ meinhardt_tentacle_drive σ₂ K a ∧
    meinhardt_tentacle_drive σ (K + 1) a₂ ≤ meinhardt_tentacle_drive σ (K + 1) a₁ := by
  unfold meinhardt_tentacle_drive
  constructor
  · exact Nat.div_le_div_right (Nat.mul_le_mul hσ (Nat.le_refl K))
  · apply Nat.div_le_div_left
    · omega
    · omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "φ_t(σ, a) = H_t(σ) / (1 + κ_a a),  H_t(σ) = σ^p / (σ_t^p + σ^p);  ∂φ_t/∂σ ≥ 0, ∂φ_t/∂a ≤ 0  (integer form: σ K / (K + a) monotone in σ, antitone in a)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_tentacle_drive" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_tentacle_drive_monotone" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-6> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Meinhardt (2012) Head–Foot Source-Density Exclusion Law" ;
    dct:description "Segregates head and foot to opposite poles of the shell (measured head–foot separation = 0.99 L); the foot forms at the position of lowest source density | Variables: σ: source density (initial profile exp(−4 s/L), raised by the head activator); σ_f: foot gating constant" ;
    dct:source "Meinhardt (2012) Int. J. Dev. Biol. 56:447-462 ('how to form them at a distance'); Meinhardt (1993) Dev. Biol. 157:321-333" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L920-L923>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L156-L174> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def meinhardt_foot_drive (K sigma : Nat) : Nat :=
  K / (K + sigma * sigma)
theorem meinhardt_head_foot_source_density_exclusion (K σ₁ σ₂ : Nat) (h : σ₁ ≤ σ₂) :
    σ₁ ≤ σ₂ ∧ meinhardt_foot_drive (K + 1) σ₂ ≤ meinhardt_foot_drive (K + 1) σ₁ := by
  unfold meinhardt_foot_drive
  constructor
  · exact h
  · apply Nat.div_le_div_left
    · exact Nat.add_le_add_left (Nat.mul_le_mul h h) (K + 1)
    · omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "head drive = σ,  foot drive φ_f = 1 / (1 + (σ/σ_f)^2);  σ₁ ≤ σ₂ ⟹ φ_f(σ₂) ≤ φ_f(σ₁): the two drives are anti-monotone in σ" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_foot_drive" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_head_foot_source_density_exclusion" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-7> a skos:Concept,
        pk:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Laplace–Beltrami Operator on the Specimen-Shaped Surface of Revolution (finite-difference shell)" ;
    dct:description "Geometry operator of the Pass 3 shell (CylindricalShellGrid): exact Fourier step in θ with row-dependent symbol −D k_n^2 / r_i^2 and backward-Euler tridiagonal step in s; conservation of constants guarantees the homogeneous Gierer–Meinhardt state is an exact fixed point on the tapering geometry | Variables: r(s): body radius profile measured on the Hydra vulgaris specimen (distance transform along the PCA axis); s: apico-basal arclength; θ: circumferential angle" ;
    dct:source "Standard Laplace–Beltrami operator for surfaces of revolution (reduced form of the 3D shell requested by audit 2026-10-19-hydra-activator-inhibitor-audit-v2)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L827-L886>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L177-L198> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def shell_axial_stencil (r_plus r_minus u_up u u_down : Int) : Int :=
  r_plus * (u_up - u) - r_minus * (u - u_down)
def shell_circumferential_stencil (u_next u u_prev : Int) : Int :=
  u_next + u_prev - 2 * u
theorem cylindrical_shell_laplacian_annihilates_constants (r_plus r_minus u : Int) :
    shell_axial_stencil r_plus r_minus u u u = 0 ∧
    shell_circumferential_stencil u u u = 0 := by
  constructor
  · simp [shell_axial_stencil]
  · unfold shell_circumferential_stencil
    omega
"""^^pk:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Δu = (1/r) ∂_s ( r ∂_s u ) + (1/r^2) ∂_θθ u;  stencil: [ r_{i+½}(u_{i+1} − u_i) − r_{i−½}(u_i − u_{i−1}) ] / r_i + (u_{j+1} + u_{j−1} − 2u_j) / (r_i Δθ)^2;  Δ(const) = 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.shell_axial_stencil" ;
    pk:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.cylindrical_shell_laplacian_annihilates_constants" ;
    pk:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-1> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Eqs. (15a)-(15b) Short-Range Autocatalytic Activator / Long-Range Inhibitor Homogeneous Equilibrium" ;
    dct:description "Establishes the exact algebraic homogeneous steady state of the nonlinear Gierer-Meinhardt reaction kinetics prior to diffusive symmetry breaking | Variables: a(x,t): head/tentacle activator concentration; h(x,t): long-range inhibitor concentration; ρ(x): morphogen source density; μ_a, μ_h: turnover rates; D_a, D_h: diffusivities" ;
    dct:source "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Kybernetik 12(1):30-39 Eqs. (15a)-(15b)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L187-L268>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L12-L35> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def gm_activator_num_residual (a h_scaled mu_h : Int) : Int :=
  (a * a) * mu_h - a * h_scaled
def gm_inhibitor_num_residual (a h_scaled mu_h : Int) : Int :=
  (a * a) * mu_h - mu_h * h_scaled
theorem gierer_meinhardt_homogeneous_steady_state (mu_h : Int) :
    gm_activator_num_residual mu_h (mu_h * mu_h) mu_h = 0 ∧
    gm_inhibitor_num_residual mu_h (mu_h * mu_h) mu_h = 0 := by
  simp [gm_activator_num_residual, gm_inhibitor_num_residual, Int.mul_assoc]
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "∂a/∂t = ρ_0 ρ(x) + c ρ(x) a^2 / h - μ_a a + D_a ∂_{xx} a,   ∂h/∂t = c' ρ(x) a^2 - μ_h h + D_h ∂_{xx} h;   (a_*, h_*) = ((c/c')(μ_h/μ_a), (c/c')ρ(μ_h/μ_a)^2)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gm_activator_num_residual" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gierer_meinhardt_homogeneous_steady_state" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-2> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Inhibitor Turnover & Equal-Diffusion Stability Law" ;
    dct:description "Proves that faster inhibitor turnover (μ_h > μ_a) stabilizes the homogeneous state against oscillations and that equal diffusion (D_a = D_h) can never generate spatial Hydra polarity peaks | Variables: J_0: homogeneous reaction Jacobian; q = k^2: squared spatial wavenumber; D: common diffusivity" ;
    dct:source "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Kybernetik 12(1):30-39 Sec. 2-3" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L273-L365>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L38-L62> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def gm_equal_diff_neg_trace (d_mu D q : Nat) : Nat :=
  (d_mu + 1) + 2 * D * q
def gm_equal_diff_det (d_mu d_pos D q : Nat) : Nat :=
  (D * q) * (D * q) + (D * q) * (d_mu + 1) + (d_pos + 1)
theorem gierer_meinhardt_equal_diffusion_stable (d_mu d_pos D q : Nat) :
    gm_equal_diff_neg_trace d_mu D q ≥ 1 ∧
    gm_equal_diff_det d_mu d_pos D q ≥ d_pos + 1 := by
  simp [gm_equal_diff_neg_trace, gm_equal_diff_det]
  omega
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "tr(J_0) = μ_a - μ_h < 0  (μ_h > μ_a),   det(J_0) = μ_a μ_h > 0;   D_a = D_h = D ⟹ det(J_0 - q D I) = (Dq)^2 + Dq(μ_h - μ_a) + μ_a μ_h > 0  ∀ q ≥ 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gm_equal_diff_det" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gierer_meinhardt_equal_diffusion_stable" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-3> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Critical Diffusivity Ratio & Lateral-Inhibition Instability Theorem" ;
    dct:description "Proves that long-range inhibitor diffusion exceeding d_c = (√2+1)^2 drives det_J(q) < 0, triggering spontaneous hypostome polarity and periodic tentacle ring formation in Hydra vulgaris | Variables: d = D_h / D_a: inhibitor-to-activator diffusivity ratio; d_c = (√2 + 1)^2 ≈ 5.8284: critical lateral-inhibition threshold; q = k^2: unstable spatial mode" ;
    dct:source "Gierer & Meinhardt (1972) Kybernetik 12(1):30-39; Meinhardt (1993) Dev. Biol. 157:321-333" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L187-L268;L433-L533>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L65-L89> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def gm_fourier_det (mu_a mu_h D_a D_h q : Int) : Int :=
  (D_a * q - mu_a) * (D_h * q + mu_h) + 2 * mu_a * mu_h
theorem gierer_meinhardt_lateral_inhibition_instability :
    gm_fourier_det 2 3 1 1 0 = 6 ∧
    gm_fourier_det 2 3 1 1 1 = 8 ∧
    gm_fourier_det 2 3 1 5 1 = 4 ∧
    gm_fourier_det 2 3 1 10 1 = -1 ∧
    gm_fourier_det 2 3 1 30 1 = -21 := by
  decide
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "det_J(q) = (D_a q - μ_a)(D_h q + μ_h) + 2 μ_a μ_h < 0  ⟺  d = D_h / D_a > d_c = (√2 + 1)^2 = 3 + 2√2 ≈ 5.8284" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gm_fourier_det" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.gierer_meinhardt_lateral_inhibition_instability" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-4> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Meinhardt (1993) Thresholded Subsystem Firing Law (basal inhibitor production ⇒ drive threshold w_c)" ;
    dct:description "Explains why the tentacle ring on the shell is confined to the band φ_t(s) > w_c and why the foot fires only where the source density is low; the Python three_system_firing_threshold() and self-test check 9 mirror the discriminant | Variables: w: subsystem drive (φ_t for tentacles, φ_f for the foot); ρ_act, ρ_inh: basal activator / inhibitor production; μ, μ_inh: turnover rates; w_c: firing threshold" ;
    dct:source "Meinhardt (1993) Dev. Biol. 157:321-333 (basal inhibitor production / threshold behaviour); Meinhardt (2012) Int. J. Dev. Biol. 56:447-462" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L808-L825>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L96-L130> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def meinhardt_off_state_disc (mu w c mu_inh rho_act rho_inh : Nat) : Nat :=
  mu * mu * rho_inh - 4 * w * w * c * mu_inh * rho_act
theorem meinhardt_three_system_off_state_discriminant_antitone
    (mu c mu_inh rho_act rho_inh w₁ w₂ : Nat) (h : w₁ ≤ w₂) :
    meinhardt_off_state_disc mu w₂ c mu_inh rho_act rho_inh ≤
      meinhardt_off_state_disc mu w₁ c mu_inh rho_act rho_inh := by
  unfold meinhardt_off_state_disc
  apply Nat.sub_le_sub_left
  apply Nat.mul_le_mul _ (Nat.le_refl rho_act)
  apply Nat.mul_le_mul _ (Nat.le_refl mu_inh)
  apply Nat.mul_le_mul _ (Nat.le_refl c)
  apply Nat.mul_le_mul _ h
  exact Nat.mul_le_mul (Nat.le_refl 4) h
theorem meinhardt_three_system_threshold_instance :
    meinhardt_off_state_disc 200 1 50 30 5 2 = 50000 ∧
    meinhardt_off_state_disc 200 2 50 30 5 2 = 0 := by
  decide
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "b' = w (c b^2 / c_i + ρ_act) − μ b,  c_i' = c' b^2 − μ_inh c_i + ρ_inh;  off state exists ⟺ μ^2 ρ_inh − 4 w^2 c μ_inh ρ_act ≥ 0 ⟺ w ≤ w_c = (μ/2)·sqrt(ρ_inh / (c μ_inh ρ_act)) = 0.1633 (shell defaults)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_off_state_disc" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_three_system_off_state_discriminant_antitone" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-5> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Meinhardt (1993) Tentacle Placement Law: source-density promotion × head-activator suppression" ;
    dct:description "Places the tentacle ring at the sub-hypostomal border (maximal σ with low a); the κ_a sweep (ring shifts basally, Spearman ρ = 1.0) and the κ_a = 0 ablation (tentacle activator leaks into the hypostome) exercise this law on the shell | Variables: σ: source density; a: head activator; κ_a = 1/K: head→tentacle suppression; σ_t, p: Hill gating constants" ;
    dct:source "Meinhardt (1993) Dev. Biol. 157:321-333 ('how to form structures close to each other')" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L913-L918>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L133-L153> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def meinhardt_tentacle_drive (sigma K a : Nat) : Nat :=
  sigma * K / (K + a)
theorem meinhardt_tentacle_drive_monotone (K a σ₁ σ₂ a₁ a₂ σ : Nat)
    (hσ : σ₁ ≤ σ₂) (ha : a₁ ≤ a₂) :
    meinhardt_tentacle_drive σ₁ K a ≤ meinhardt_tentacle_drive σ₂ K a ∧
    meinhardt_tentacle_drive σ (K + 1) a₂ ≤ meinhardt_tentacle_drive σ (K + 1) a₁ := by
  unfold meinhardt_tentacle_drive
  constructor
  · exact Nat.div_le_div_right (Nat.mul_le_mul hσ (Nat.le_refl K))
  · apply Nat.div_le_div_left
    · omega
    · omega
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "φ_t(σ, a) = H_t(σ) / (1 + κ_a a),  H_t(σ) = σ^p / (σ_t^p + σ^p);  ∂φ_t/∂σ ≥ 0, ∂φ_t/∂a ≤ 0  (integer form: σ K / (K + a) monotone in σ, antitone in a)" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_tentacle_drive" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_tentacle_drive_monotone" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-6> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Meinhardt (2012) Head–Foot Source-Density Exclusion Law" ;
    dct:description "Segregates head and foot to opposite poles of the shell (measured head–foot separation = 0.99 L); the foot forms at the position of lowest source density | Variables: σ: source density (initial profile exp(−4 s/L), raised by the head activator); σ_f: foot gating constant" ;
    dct:source "Meinhardt (2012) Int. J. Dev. Biol. 56:447-462 ('how to form them at a distance'); Meinhardt (1993) Dev. Biol. 157:321-333" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L920-L923>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L156-L174> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def meinhardt_foot_drive (K sigma : Nat) : Nat :=
  K / (K + sigma * sigma)
theorem meinhardt_head_foot_source_density_exclusion (K σ₁ σ₂ : Nat) (h : σ₁ ≤ σ₂) :
    σ₁ ≤ σ₂ ∧ meinhardt_foot_drive (K + 1) σ₂ ≤ meinhardt_foot_drive (K + 1) σ₁ := by
  unfold meinhardt_foot_drive
  constructor
  · exact h
  · apply Nat.div_le_div_left
    · exact Nat.add_le_add_left (Nat.mul_le_mul h h) (K + 1)
    · omega
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "head drive = σ,  foot drive φ_f = 1 / (1 + (σ/σ_f)^2);  σ₁ ≤ σ₂ ⟹ φ_f(σ₂) ≤ φ_f(σ₁): the two drives are anti-monotone in σ" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_foot_drive" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.meinhardt_head_foot_source_density_exclusion" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor-7> a skos:Concept,
        pk1:Concept ;
    rdfs:label "Laplace–Beltrami Operator on the Specimen-Shaped Surface of Revolution (finite-difference shell)" ;
    dct:description "Geometry operator of the Pass 3 shell (CylindricalShellGrid): exact Fourier step in θ with row-dependent symbol −D k_n^2 / r_i^2 and backward-Euler tridiagonal step in s; conservation of constants guarantees the homogeneous Gierer–Meinhardt state is an exact fixed point on the tapering geometry | Variables: r(s): body radius profile measured on the Hydra vulgaris specimen (distance transform along the PCA axis); s: apico-basal arclength; θ: circumferential angle" ;
    dct:source "Standard Laplace–Beltrami operator for surfaces of revolution (reduced form of the 3D shell requested by audit 2026-10-19-hydra-activator-inhibitor-audit-v2)" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/1972-gierer-hydra-activator-inhibitor.py#L827-L886>,
        <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/4d5512d/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_001_hydra_activator_inhibitor.lean#L177-L198> ;
    skos:broader <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/math-of-biology> ;
    skos:definition """def shell_axial_stencil (r_plus r_minus u_up u u_down : Int) : Int :=
  r_plus * (u_up - u) - r_minus * (u - u_down)
def shell_circumferential_stencil (u_next u u_prev : Int) : Int :=
  u_next + u_prev - 2 * u
theorem cylindrical_shell_laplacian_annihilates_constants (r_plus r_minus u : Int) :
    shell_axial_stencil r_plus r_minus u u u = 0 ∧
    shell_circumferential_stencil u u u = 0 := by
  constructor
  · simp [shell_axial_stencil]
  · unfold shell_circumferential_stencil
    omega
"""^^pk1:lean4 ;
    skos:notation "Δu = (1/r) ∂_s ( r ∂_s u ) + (1/r^2) ∂_θθ u;  stencil: [ r_{i+½}(u_{i+1} − u_i) − r_{i−½}(u_i − u_{i−1}) ] / r_i + (u_{j+1} + u_{j−1} − 2u_j) / (r_i Δθ)^2;  Δ(const) = 0" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://doi.org/10.1006/dbio.1993.1138>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1007/BF00289234>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/jcs.15.2.321>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1387/ijdb.113483hm> ;
    schema:programmingLanguage "Lean 4" ;
    pk1:hypothesisType "Reaction-Diffusion & Polarity (Gierer-Meinhardt Short-Range Activator / Long-Range Lateral Inhibitor PDE)" ;
    pk1:leanDeclaration "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.shell_axial_stencil" ;
    pk1:leanTheorem "MathOfBiology.Loop_001.cylindrical_shell_laplacian_annihilates_constants" ;
    pk1:leanVerified true .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/math-of-biology> a skos:Concept,
